<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xylan cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xylan cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it downgraded Xylan Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, Xylan said its second quarter results would be lower than those posted during the company's first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-1/2 to 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
